<title>CHINA: Grande says unit to list in KL on July 2.</title>
<headline>Grande says unit to list in KL on July 2.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grande Holdings Ltd said on Friday its subsidiary Capetronic Consumer Electronics Holdings Berhand (CCE) would start trading on the second board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on July 21.</p>
<p>Grande said the listing of CCE would proceed by way of a new issue and offer for sale and the conditions for the listing had been approved by the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>In March, Grande said it would restrcuture CCE prior to the listing in Kuala Lumpur. It said CCE would offer 10 million shares to the public.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
